age
Usage: age -e -p -o OUT.age FILE   |   age -d -o FILE OUT.age

Modern file encryption with no gpg keyring to manage -- encrypt to a passphrase
or to a keypair, decrypt on the other end. For sealing loot before you carry or
send it.

	-e            encrypt
	-p            use a passphrase (prompts)
	-o FILE       write to this output
	-d            decrypt
	-r RECIPIENT  encrypt to a public key instead of a passphrase

See also: minisign, zstd
